note Exercism-style exercise "difference-of-squares": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/difference-of-squares
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note sqsum n is the square of the sum 1 .. n, sumsq n the sum of the squares, and
note diffsq n the first minus the second.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/difference-of-squares
om2
fn sqsum n ulong to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
fn sumsq n ulong to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
fn diffsq n ulong to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
